<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOULOUSE, France 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in</p>
<p>the $400,000 men's Toulouse indoor tennis Grand Prix on Friday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Bernd Karbacher (Germany) 6-1 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2)</p>
<p>4-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco)</p>
<p>6-4 3-6 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>7-Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat 2-Cedric Pioline (France) 6-4 6-3 1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Orlin Stanoichev (Bulgaria) 7-6 (9-7) 6-3</p>
</text>
